      "role": "assistant",
      "content": "It sounds like you are experiencing significant anxiety about being constantly evaluated, which can make everyday tasks feel incredibly high-stakes. Instead of focusing on an assumed surveillance, try shifting your focus to small, achievable goals for routine structure this week. Establishing consistent sleep, hydration, and a predictable morning schedule can significantly reduce background stress. Remember that complete perfection is often unachievable, so aim for sustainable consistency over flawlessness.",
      "source": "target",
